@startuml
title LSW 组件调用关系
actor User
component "lsw CLI" as CLI
component "lsw_core" as Core
component "lswd" as Daemon
component "shell 模块\n(cwd→Z: / EncodedCommand)" as Shell
component "exec 模块\n(路径解析/复制/PE GUI 检测)" as Exec
component "QEMU/KVM" as QEMU
component "QMP Client" as QMP
component "Windows OpenSSH" as WinSSH
component "PowerShell / cmd" as PS
component "SMB/CIFS" as SMB
component "lsw-mount-helper\n(sudo/pkexec)" as Helper
component "libsecret keyring" as Keyring
component "Linux $HOME" as Home

User --> CLI
CLI --> Core
CLI --> Daemon : shell / exec IPC\nUnix Socket JSON
Daemon --> Core
Daemon --> Shell : build_shell_ssh_args
Daemon --> Exec : resolve_target + build_exec_ssh_args
Daemon --> QEMU : spawn
Daemon --> QMP : control\n$RUNTIME/lsw/qmp.sock
QMP --> QEMU
CLI --> WinSSH : execvp ssh -t（shell 接管终端）
Daemon --> WinSSH : ssh 非交互（exec 捕获输出）\nstatus 探测 hostname/virtio
WinSSH --> PS
PS --> SMB : Z:（host Samba 共享）
Daemon --> Keyring : secret-tool 凭据读写
Daemon --> Helper : mount / unmount\nSamba start/stop；密码仅 stdin
Helper --> SMB : mount -t cifs
SMB --> Home : Z: → $HOME
@enduml
